   "text": "Herzing College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nHerzing College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFor over 55 years, Herzing College has been helping people transition back to school and into fulfilling careers, including students with busy schedules and tight budgets. A Career-focused education is an education that provides students with marketable skills that employers are seeking. Each campus works closely with local and regional employers to ensure that Herzing programs encompass the skills and knowledge needed for their students to succeed. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:20\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:20\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$16,414.00\nMin: CA$15,262.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n35%\n2,100 of 6,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1965\nCampus(es)\nMontreal\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n21/07/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AGrgyflb9iA\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
